        "query_signature": "Choose feasible action $x_t\\in X$ and receive one exact gradient there. Inputs $X,T,D,G,\\alpha$ are public; Euclidean projection onto $X$ is available at arithmetic cost $\\mathsf{EP}_X$. Causal learners obey this timing. Past feedback may be stored and reused computationally; no additional historical or sample queries are available beyond the explicitly declared interface.",
